    {
      "id": "QyZaxOKHL4xkj9nBdqNgb",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -4098.666666666667,
      "y": -746.8333333333328,
      "width": 246.80462646484375,
      "height": 113.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#3c3c3c",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b8U",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1721569704,
      "version": 93,
      "versionNonce": 1511443880,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782859412138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Costly and slow: ~11 LLM + 20+ tool\n  calls per decision (capped test at 3 mo).\n- Thin test: 3 months, few big tech names;\n  high Sharpe blamed on few pullbacks,\n  not a real edge.\n- Equities-only; not a macro / FX design.\n- No transaction-cost or execution model.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Costly and slow: ~11 LLM + 20+ tool\n  calls per decision (capped test at 3 mo).\n- Thin test: 3 months, few big tech names;\n  high Sharpe blamed on few pullbacks,\n  not a real edge.\n- Equities-only; not a macro / FX design.\n- No transaction-cost or execution model.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
