      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782859412138,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Read scope per agent: the whole board, or\n  only upstream outputs? It just says\n  'queries what it needs'.\n- How facilitators pick the winner and the\n  risk adjustment.\n- How the number of debate rounds is set.\n- Full model-per-role mapping (partly in\n  the appendix).",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
