      "updated": 1782916932627,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Why they chose it",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Why they chose it",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
    {
      "id": "nU8OEWcXv7OTlw7l7h-Ti",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -3348.666666666667,
      "y": -1200.8333333333328,
      "width": 412.8594970703125,
      "height": 122.5,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b9k",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 397429672,
      "version": 98,
      "versionNonce": 1153692072,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1782859412140,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "- Real Fed members rarely disagree, and usually agree before the\n  meeting starts, so plain math models cannot copy them. [F]\n- So they run two versions from the SAME start: one talks (AI),\n  one is pure math, to measure what the talking adds. [F]\n- They lean on the middle (median) on purpose, so one loud voice\n  cannot swing the answer, like the real Fed. [F]\n- It is a 'what if' sandbox, not a fortune teller. [F]",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "- Real Fed members rarely disagree, and usually agree before the\n  meeting starts, so plain math models cannot copy them. [F]\n- So they run two versions from the SAME start: one talks (AI),\n  one is pure math, to measure what the talking adds. [F]\n- They lean on the middle (median) on purpose, so one loud voice\n  cannot swing the answer, like the real Fed. [F]\n- It is a 'what if' sandbox, not a fortune teller. [F]",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
