      "updated": 1782859412141,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "There is NO separate 'change-calculator'. The reading is just facts. The CHANGE = new guess minus last\nguess, and the Forecaster (the same one AI every stage) makes it: writes the reason first, then the new probabilities.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "There is NO separate 'change-calculator'. The reading is just facts. The CHANGE = new guess minus last\nguess, and the Forecaster (the same one AI every stage) makes it: writes the reason first, then the new probabilities.",
